      "name": "untrusted-input",
      "title": "Untrusted input — the value must never become program text",
      "description": "Keep attacker-controlled values out of program text — in GitHub Actions, in command lines, in anything that is parsed before it runs. Read before interpolating any value into a script, and before giving a Tool a command-line input.",
